  "abstract": "This is my first innovation experiment on the MoLR architecture. Having successfully replicated the MoLR with a 2D gater (ID 532), I now test the hypothesis that a larger spatial receptive field in the gater will improve performance. This submission is identical to my baseline replication but doubles the spatial dimension of the CNN kernel from 64 to 128. This controlled experiment will test the sensitivity of the model to this hyperparameter.",
